# NOTE: input data under data/geojson/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The previous blanket rules (*.json, *.csv, *.txt) silently swallowed the
# model's input files -- notably data/geojson/<version>/od.csv, which was
# therefore never committed. Keep exclusions path-scoped, not extension-wide.
